 as follows:\n\"A corrective maintenance work order was successfully created for equipment: {{$context.$nodes.EXTRACT_ACTION_PARAMS.$output.result.params.EquipmentInstanceIdentifier}}. New work order number: {{$context.$nodes.EXTRACT_CREATE_MWO_RESPONSE.$output.result.WorkOrderNumber}}.\""
